**/*.pdf
target/
tune_plots/
__pycache__/
**/*CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/*.zip
# colcon build logs (this repo is also a colcon workspace root)
log/

# Downloaded papers: 48 MB of third-party PDFs. Not ours to redistribute, and reproducible from
# docs/references.bib (every entry carries its arXiv id). The .bib and the fetch script ARE
# tracked, so a clone can rebuild the library; the PDFs themselves are not.
docs/papers/*.pdf

# LaTeX build artefacts. The .tex and .bib are tracked; everything a build regenerates is not.
docs/thesis/*.pdf
docs/thesis/*.aux
docs/thesis/*.bbl
docs/thesis/*.blg
docs/thesis/*.log
docs/thesis/*.out
docs/thesis/*.fls
docs/thesis/*.fdb_latexmk
docs/thesis/*.toc
